  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "The one rule",
      "items": [
        "The agent edits files freely; it commits or pushes only after you approve what it shows",
        "An approved commit, whoever runs it, is the signature that makes anything permanent",
        "Until then, everything it wrote is a proposal you can read in any editor"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Four doors",
      "items": [
        "A thought hit me → just say it",
        "What should I do next? → your approved plan answers",
        "Think this through with me → it pulls in what you told it before",
